<span class="ln"> 125</span>      # OpenCV kernels are centred on one pixel.  A seven-pixel physical-width
<span class="ln"> 126</span>      # requirement therefore uses a 7x7 footprint (radius three), not a 9x9
<span class="ln"> 127</span>      # footprint (radius four).  If ceil() produces an even number, round the
